            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm planning a movie marathon with my family over the long weekend and I want to re-watch some classic films from my childhood. Can you recommend some popular movies from the 80s and 90s that are suitable for a family movie night?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-20",
            "sequence": 1,
            "source_id": "80856-1791156321862460000-587"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "coverage_gaps",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "Can you suggest some MCU films that are suitable for my family movie night as well? I've been on a Marvel binge recently and I'd love to share that with my family."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-20",
            "sequence": 2,
            "source_id": "80856-1791156356650427000-608"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I've actually watched 4 MCU films in the last 3 months, and I think Spider-Man: Homecoming would be a great choice for our family movie night. Can you give me some suggestions for snacks and activities that would complement the movie?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-20",
            "sequence": 3,
            "source_id": "80856-1791156486038686000-639"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "no_candidates_unreviewed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I was thinking of creating a Marvel-themed photo booth with props like Spider-Man masks and capes. Do you have any suggestions for other props I could include?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-20",
            "sequence": 4,
            "source_id": "80856-1791156675165539000-673"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "That's a great list of props! I think I'll also include some DIY signs that say \"Spider-Man's Neighborhood\" or \"Queens, NY\" to give it a more authentic feel. Do you have any suggestions for how to create a DIY cityscape backdrop?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-20",
            "sequence": 5,
            "source_id": "80856-1791156693246696000-687"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I think I'll go with the cardboard box cityscape option. It's easy to set up and can be customized to fit my Spider-Man theme. I'll also add some DIY signs that say \"Spider-Man's Neighborhood\" or \"Queens, NY\" to give it a more authentic feel. Thanks for the ideas!"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-20",
            "sequence": 6,
            "source_id": "80856-1791156879594392000-743"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "failed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm planning a movie marathon with my family over the upcoming long weekend and I want to include some classic movies from my childhood. Can you give me some suggestions on what to watch? By the way, I've been on a roll with movies lately - I've watched 12 films in the last 3 months, including 5 MCU films, which is a lot for me!"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-25",
            "sequence": 7,
            "source_id": "80856-1791157072721848000-789"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I was thinking of including The Lion King and Back to the Future in the marathon, but I'm not sure about the others. Can you give me more info on The Goonies and The NeverEnding Story? Are they suitable for kids?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-25",
            "sequence": 8,
            "source_id": "80856-1791157231446906000-835"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I think The Goonies sounds like a great addition to the marathon. I'll add it to the list. The NeverEnding Story might be a bit too intense for some of the younger kids in my family, so I might save that for a later time. Thanks for the suggestions!"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-25",
            "sequence": 9,
            "source_id": "80856-1791157359910149000-886"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "no_candidates_unreviewed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "That's a great idea about the snacks and activities! I think I'll plan a treasure hunt with clues inspired by The Goonies, and serve some popcorn and snacks during the movies. What about some movie-themed games or quizzes during the breaks? Do you have any suggestions?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-25",
            "sequence": 10,
            "source_id": "80856-1791157572319739000-947"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "That's a great list of ideas! I think I'll go with the movie trivia and quote-along competition. They seem like a lot of fun and easy to set up. Do you think I could also have a \"guess the movie poster\" game, where I print out posters of different movies and they have to guess which one it is?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-25",
            "sequence": 11,
